# wfg-log 1
# fixture sampler - a sampler group armed, played, taken over and disarmed
# (Phase 6, PR 6.4; re-recorded 2026-09-23 when a touch became the start).
#
# WHAT IT IS FOR: that the decisions a sampler bank makes - arming onto
# strips, presses and releases, a touch that starts a clip, a takeover by
# strip and a disarm - are all records, and reproduce exactly. Recorded from
# a real `wfg serve` of tests/fixtures/bundles/sampler driven over OSC from
# one UDP socket, with no audio device; the header lines below are the
# session's own.
#
# bundle sampler sha256:9b6c6f0f78ff33256c1b057b2a9ee07b6def67ab198fe0ae575943bda9e31b82
# clock sampleRate=48000 blockSize=128 samplesPerTick=960
# media bell.wav 0 0.000
# media door.wav 0 0.000
# media owl.wav 0 0.000
# media rain.wav 0 0.000
# media thunder.wav 0 0.000
# media wind.wav 0 0.000
#
# The horizon prepares Bank A while the pointer rests on it: a sampler group
# is a place to stand, and its header - none here - would run ahead.
A 0 0 engine run.prepare s:"SMP00002" s:"YTGQCZ9P"
#
# GO ARMS THE BANK: every media member onto the virtual panel's strips in
# order, each a run of its own, each waiting for a hand, each fader at its
# member's initial level. The standby moves to Bank B and never descends
# into A: a sampler group is a window on the side of the cues.
A 15 1 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 go s:"YTGQCZ9P"
A 16 2 engine run.prepare s:"SMP00007" s:"CWJ3VT4D"
A 17 3 engine run.spawn s:"YTGQCZ9P" s:"SMP00003" s:"YV3KST15"
A 17 4 engine run.spawn s:"YTGQCZ9P" s:"SMP00004" s:"BPDDSN4A"
A 17 5 engine run.spawn s:"YTGQCZ9P" s:"SMP00005" s:"G8M6D5YN"
A 17 6 engine run.spawn s:"YTGQCZ9P" s:"SMP00006" s:"WMEMYGHZ"
#
# Two pads. Thunder is a hold clip, so the hand that pressed it owns it; Rain
# has velocity on, so 64 sets where it starts. No audio device here, so
# neither sounds - what the log carries is what the hands decided.
A 22 7 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 strip.press s:"STRP0001"
A 22 8 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 strip.press s:"STRP0002" i:64
#
# Thunder let go before it sounded: the launch is withdrawn and the member
# stays armed, and nothing starts it again but a hand landing on its fader.
A 35 9 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 strip.release s:"STRP0001"
#
# A HAND LANDS ON DOOR'S FADER, which waits at Door's initial level: that is
# the start (author, 2026-09-23), and the engine's own strip.press is its
# record, because a replay runs no hooks. Taken to the bottom and let go,
# Door is play-out, so it is a mute and not a stop.
A 45 10 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 node.touch s:"/godot/run/WMEMYGHZ/trim"
A 46 11 engine strip.press s:"STRP0004"
A 55 12 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 node.set s:"/godot/run/WMEMYGHZ/trim" f:-120
A 55 13 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 node.release s:"/godot/run/WMEMYGHZ/trim"
#
# GO ON BANK B, takeover=strip: its two members land on strips one and two.
# Thunder, idle, is ended at once so the strip hands over; Rain was asked to
# launch, so it keeps its strip until its run ends - eviction is a close,
# not a kill - and Bank B's second member waits for it.
A 66 14 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 go s:"CWJ3VT4D"
A 68 15 engine run.spawn s:"CWJ3VT4D" s:"SMP00008" s:"74SMXTQB"
A 68 16 engine run.spawn s:"CWJ3VT4D" s:"SMP00009" s:"VD63847H"
A 69 17 engine run.kill s:"YV3KST15"
A 70 18 engine run.ended s:"YV3KST15"
#
# THE STOP CUE AIMED AT BANK A disarms it: its members are killed, it ends,
# and the strip Rain held goes to the member that was waiting.
A 93 19 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 go s:"PRP0QWSQ"
A 94 20 engine run.kill s:"BPDDSN4A"
A 94 21 engine run.kill s:"G8M6D5YN"
A 94 22 engine run.kill s:"WMEMYGHZ"
A 94 23 engine run.ended s:"YTGQCZ9P"
A 94 24 engine run.ended s:"PRP0QWSQ"
A 95 25 engine run.ended s:"BPDDSN4A"
A 95 26 engine run.ended s:"G8M6D5YN"
A 95 27 engine run.ended s:"WMEMYGHZ"
#
# And the list carries on.
A 120 28 udp:127.0.0.1:52623 go s:"15H9NZVH"
A 121 29 engine run.ended s:"15H9NZVH"
